Third-party components fetched at build time (not included in this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The firmware build clones the LilyGO board-support repository into vendor/,
which supplies the board definition and several drivers. These carry their own
licenses, which apply to those components rather than to this project:

  epdiy (e-paper driver)            LGPL-3.0-or-later   https://github.com/vroland/epdiy
  SensorLib (touch, IO expander)    MIT                 https://github.com/lewisxhe/SensorLib
  TinyGPSPlus                       LGPL-2.1            https://github.com/mikalhart/TinyGPSPlus
  BQ27220 (fuel gauge)              see vendor source
  LilyGO T5S3-4.7-e-paper-PRO       see upstream repo   https://github.com/Xinyuan-LilyGO/T5S3-4.7-e-paper-PRO

PlatformIO additionally resolves:

  NimBLE-Arduino                    Apache-2.0          https://github.com/h2zero/NimBLE-Arduino
  arduino-esp32 / ESP-IDF           Apache-2.0 / LGPL   https://github.com/espressif

